  84                       PDP=    0002                    /GOTO PDP-8 MODE
  85                       REVISIO="D&77                   /REVISION OF SYSTAT
  86                       SBTFUN= 7602                    /SYSTEM BOOTSTRAP UNIT WORD
  87                       SCRSIZE=7611                    /SYSTEM CORE SIZE WORD
